+Photon Node binding compatibility patch
+======================================
+
+Component: @silvia-odwyer/photon-node, version 0.3.4
+Copyright 2023, Silvia O'Dwyer
+License: Apache License, Version 2.0
+
+The complete license from the published 0.3.4 package is reproduced unchanged
