+Package source:
+https://www.npmjs.com/package/@silvia-odwyer/photon-node/v/0.3.4
+https://registry.npmjs.org/@silvia-odwyer/photon-node/-/photon-node-0.3.4.tgz
+Upstream repository:
+https://github.com/silvia-odwyer/photon
+Published package gitHead:
+https://github.com/silvia-odwyer/photon/tree/685f5b155b36c5611c08ca678bb78ddbab3edbac
+
+The adjacent @silvia-odwyer%2Fphoton-node@0.3.4.patch modifies photon_rs.js:
+- Uses a dedicated object for WebAssembly import bindings instead of binding
+  them to the changing CommonJS export object.
+- Allows an explicit embedded WebAssembly resource path for Bun compiled
+  executables, while retaining the package-relative resource fallback.
+
+This is an application compatibility modification, not an upstream release.
+The upstream package and its recorded source revision contain no separate
+NOTICE file. This file documents the component attribution and local changes;
+it does not replace or modify the Apache-2.0 license terms.
+
+Only the source patch and notices are distributed here. No Photon WebAssembly
+binary or package archive is included in this source distribution.
